      "name": "Grant",
      "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:20:14.999Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Similar problem with the <code>Job Card</code> DocType - users couldn’t assign to employees. What I did was use the Role Permission Manager and assigned only “Select” to the “Manufacturing Manager” role for the <code>Employee</code> DocType. I feel like this is cleaner and safer than ignoring permissions.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/26d106a87d91046e9ff9bb1fc47f8b13e98664ac.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/26d106a87d91046e9ff9bb1fc47f8b13e98664ac\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/26d106a87d91046e9ff9bb1fc47f8b13e98664ac_2_690x191.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5xnYLfJoEtluYBm7UTi7JdZPeBC\" width=\"690\" height=\"191\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/26d106a87d91046e9ff9bb1fc47f8b13e98664ac_2_690x191.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/26d106a87d91046e9ff9bb1fc47f8b13e98664ac_2_1035x286.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/26d106a87d91046e9ff9bb1fc47f8b13e98664ac.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1271×352 22 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
